            "fileSize": 24700831
          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers are excited to head to the Coastal Cliffs of the Shetland Islands to record the chorus of squawks and caws of its Atlantic Puffins, Razorbills, and Guillemots. But on their way back home, they overhear some thuds coming from the ocean floor. The crew follows the sound and discovers Blue Tang Shoe, an over-the top sporty bad guy who wears a pair of squeaky sneakers designed to resemble Blue Tang fish. Blue Tang Shoe is trying to kick a ball, but is mostly just kicking the helpless sea urchins who are in his path across the sandy ground! The Seven Cs Solver offers COMMUNITY as a way to stop him, and the Soundtrekker crew must come up with a way for Blue Tang Shoe to learn to play nicely with others!",
